# Phase 1: Brainstorming & Ideation

## Project Name
FitBuddy

## Problem Statement
Many people want to maintain a healthy lifestyle but do not know how to plan their workouts, diet, and fitness activities properly. Beginners may also find it difficult to choose suitable exercises and maintain consistency.

## Idea
FitBuddy is a fitness assistance application designed to help users maintain a healthy lifestyle. It provides a simple platform where users can enter their basic fitness information and receive suitable fitness guidance.

## Target Users
- Beginners in fitness
- Students
- People who want to maintain a healthy lifestyle
- People who want simple workout guidance

## Proposed Solution
FitBuddy provides users with a simple and user-friendly fitness platform. It can collect user information such as age, weight, height, and fitness goals and provide suitable fitness recommendations.

## Key Features
- User fitness information
- Fitness goal selection
- Workout recommendations
- Fitness plan generation
- Simple and user-friendly interface
- Health and fitness guidance

## Expected Outcome
The expected outcome is a simple fitness application that helps users understand and manage their fitness activities more easily.
